(969, 301, '03/2023 - 08/2023', '', 'SQLI Maroc', 'Developed frontend features for an international e-commerce platform en utilisant React.\r\nIntegrated REST APIs for dynamic data management.\r\nOptimized performance and accessibility of UI components.\r\nParticipated in Agile sprints and code reviews.', 'React, REST APIs'),
