(981, 304, 'August 2025 - Present', 'Servicenow Consultant', 'Capgemini / Client ENGIE / Client Airbus France', 'Managed and optimized HR Service Delivery (HRSD) module, ensuring stability and continuous improvement of HR Case Management processes\r\nDeveloped interactive dashboards and reports to provide real-time visibility on ticket status, SLA compliance, and team performance\r\nInvestigated and resolved Level 1/2 incidents, identifying root causes and implementing long-term fixes\r\nAutomated repetitive HR workflows using Flow Designer, reducing manual effort and processing time\r\nCollaborated with HR stakeholders to refine requirements and improve user experience\r\n\r\nClient Airbus France\r\nLed the design and development of a custom CSM Workspace dedicated to aircraft parts management, delivered within a 3-month project timeline\r\nBuilt a custom Record Producer embedded within the Workspace, enabling streamlined case creation directly from the user interface\r\nDesigned a scalable case structure supporting up to 200+ tasks per case, aligned with complex operational workflows\r\nImplemented dynamic task orchestration, where each task follows its own dedicated workflow using Flow Designer and Workflow Editor\r\nConfigured advanced logic using Business Rules, Script Includes, and UI Policies to manage task dependencies and execution flows\r\nOptimized user experience by centralizing operations within a single Workspace, reducing navigation complexity and improving efficiency\r\nCollaborated with business stakeholders to gather requirements and translate them into a robust and scalable ServiceNow solution\r\nDelivered the solution end-to-end (design, development, testing, and deployment), ensuring performance and maintainability', 'HRSD, Flow Designer, CSM Workspace, Record Producer, Workflow Editor, Business Rules, Script Includes, UI Policies'),
(982, 304, 'August 2024 - August 2025', 'CONSULTANT SERVICENOW', 'Flow Digital / Client: Deloitte/Metrolinx CAN', 'Participated in solution architecture and design sessions, proposing scalable and maintainable ServiceNow implementations\r\nDelivered client demos and Proof of Concepts (PoCs) to showcase platform capabilities\r\nDeveloped advanced Performance Analytics dashboards, KPIs, and automated indicators for executive reporting\r\nImplemented ITIL processes including Change Management and Knowledge Management\r\nAutomated workflows using Flow Designer and improved operational efficiency\r\nCollaborated in Agile/Scrum teams, contributing to sprint planning, backlog refinement, and delivery', 'Performance Analytics, Flow Designer, Agile/Scrum'),
